 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"7deecc43-c471-4fec-8d57-f511c86ce6dd"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
From the centre of a 3 \[Times] 3 grid eight rays leave, two through each \
neighbour, each ending at a corner.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"984019fb-5c52-4000-8ec3-d9fb6fc78a34"],

